
export anchor Story_4930cf3913a68c50:
    userPrompt:
        \\\
        In planning mode, the user can ask the agent to research a topic. Research runs as a read-only investigation that produces findings the user can read. After research, planning pauses and nothing is implemented until the user explicitly resumes or approves. The pause state is visible in the UI and persists across reloads.
        \\\

    mode: combined

    model: opus
